    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2207220/extras/624b57d0b1fae00b04228d6c0bf42881.avif?t=1697314869\" /></div><br>Fall onto a planet where only water will survive. Explore, complete missions from the outback. Or even loot. In the world of Fish Bone, you will find different technologies, magic and eras on each island. play.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2207220/extras/9cfd18f6a41a4f71a9447c864adc45bb.poster.avif?t=1697314869\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2207220/extras/9cfd18f6a41a4f71a9447c864adc45bb.webm?t=1697314869\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2207220/extras/9cfd18f6a41a4f71a9447c864adc45bb.mp4?t=1697314869\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>survival<br>-Explore resources It's the main factor you need to look for.<br>- Craft weapons, tools contribute to the number of more resource acquisitions.<br>-Build buildings such as walls to protect monsters.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2207220/extras/a94a3a76a7e6d3e852cffe7e2efa7080.poster.avif?t=1697314869\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2207220/extras/a94a3a76a7e6d3e852cffe7e2efa7080.webm?t=1697314869\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2207220/extras/a94a3a76a7e6d3e852cffe7e2efa7080.mp4?t=1697314869\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Build a ship and decorate it<br>-artillery<br>- Armor<br>- large drill<br><br>survey<br>-Explore a world full of water You must have a vehicle<br>- Various treasures are waiting for you to find.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2207220/extras/9cc57b690d01f1ba3ce5dd48df2c9a71.avif?t=1697314869\" /></div><br>Play as a bounty hunter to receive large amounts of prize money<br><br>Build a workshop to produce tools and materials.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2207220/extras/1a39653abf0bfe71e3eaac0c93ecbb7d.poster.avif?t=1697314869\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2207220/extras/1a39653abf0bfe71e3eaac0c93ecbb7d.webm?t=1697314869\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2207220/extras/1a39653abf0bfe71e3eaac0c93ecbb7d.mp4?t=1697314869\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2207220/extras/f634f0b68272542601de457dbc6443b5.poster.avif?t=1697314869\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2207220/extras/f634f0b68272542601de457dbc6443b5.webm?t=1697314869\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2207220/extras/f634f0b68272542601de457dbc6443b5.mp4?t=1697314869\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2207220/extras/39dc41d116e9fddd334498f91d799bbe.poster.avif?t=1697314869\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2207220/extras/39dc41d116e9fddd334498f91d799bbe.webm?t=1697314869\" type=\"video/